### Verbo PUT – atualiza
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/produto/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
"nome" : "coxinha",
"descricao" : "descrição",
"foto" : "",
"valor_unitario" : "5.00"
}

### Verbo DELETE - excluir
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/produto/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}} 